  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1831\">\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1741\"><strong data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1739\">Inclusion (Biological Father Likely):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1831\">\n<li data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1831\">\n<p data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1831\"><strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1781\">&ge;99.9% Probability of Paternity</strong> with concordant STR results across tested loci.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1971\">\n<p data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1875\"><strong data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1873\">Exclusion (Not Biological Father):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1971\">\n<li data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1971\">\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1971\"><strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1914\">&lt;0.1% Probability of Paternity</strong> with &ge;2 mismatched loci (not explainable by mutation).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2057\">\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1997\"><strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1995\">Mother&rsquo;s Sample:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2057\">\n<li data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2057\">\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2057\">Recommended for improved accuracy, but not mandatory.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2234\">\n<p data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2083\"><strong data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2081\">Legal Reporting:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2234\">\n<li data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2160\">\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2160\">Must follow <strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2120\">chain of custody</strong> if required for court/legal purposes.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2234\">\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2234\">Report signed by a <strong data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2231\">qualified geneticist or molecular biologist</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
